    {
      "category": "Account Termination",
      "severity": "High",
      "exact_quote": "QuickBite may deactivate your account at any time without prior warning if our automated fraud detection flags excessive refund requests or chargebacks. Upon deactivation, any unused QuickBite promotional credits or gift card balances in your in-app wallet are immediately forfeited without compensation.",
      "plain_english_summary": "The company can close your account without warning and keep any leftover gift card money or credits you have.",
      "actionable_tip": "Try not to keep a large cash balance sitting in your in-app wallet; spend your credits and gift card money quickly."
